#: scenario7:scenario7_19C8A4BC_99C1_487D_8145_8D0EA7C19F58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57395fab9a617121ad97203a7a36c05b43d9782204044afa6fdfe5e4c97afedb
#. default-sha256: 6ab9147508e3e6a36f0031a9e319eb1267d78f0d2f2d3b9d02be6705c200fa1e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_19C8A4BC_99C1_487D_8145_8D0EA7C19F58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After being pierced by Didier’s blade,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I found myself looking down upon my own "
"corpse."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……被大哥迪迪尔用剑夺去性命的我……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫回过神来，⟪k:3⟫正俯视着自己。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_80A15A9D_1B5F_42D0_A41D_B1D1F2177CA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b15a1a1fe88de5196b4f7ee9000ee60eb10ac3516b639997411aad4c0f9015d
#. default-sha256: d03db81ea33f4e91e48d70b4da891202bcd31d7a27712b06ffd2f7c72d80fbfd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80A15A9D_1B5F_42D0_A41D_B1D1F2177CA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I watched as my eldest brother dragged me to the place of my crucifixion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我亲眼看到自己，⟪k:1⟫被哥哥亲手……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫一路拖到刑场上。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6BA73D07_65B7_4AFD_884C_81E2F012DF25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 412572ebfe25c13380decd0a4e0bc01e568a22f6dac03ae698fa3952bc39cc3a
#. default-sha256: 87607555bd5367437d7a7fd651e93a1615f6924c38f2eee2ea0c1110f057d18f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6BA73D07_65B7_4AFD_884C_81E2F012DF25"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The knights!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫骑士大人！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8B7324EA_75E9_434E_B1E0_E73B255130B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70aa4a49f7a5cee1c9b1482317d59b6b5f688413779c60595a125e4d7c24b564
#. default-sha256: d51f4eeaf12ff0a5cb080c24f360db38780c632ea4cf73895b6bea2b3b55bef1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8B7324EA_75E9_434E_B1E0_E73B255130B5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men who had come to ransack the mansion were standing there, staring at my body in awe."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫是曾经来袭击洋馆的那群人……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫他们表情恍惚地看着我的尸体。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_ED90C3D4_9453_4321_A580_7F1D34EEEF7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9713426066d9f6ce0707aa99927e2fe29fa5a6a166dd18eb658a09a544685776
#. default-sha256: 6489a11a2979d31fb8350a9d9c25b96dd4fb697b3891436d760bbcbcf587d981
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ED90C3D4_9453_4321_A580_7F1D34EEEF7D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, the Lord’s judgment has been delivered unto the witch of the cursed mansion by His holy "
"servants."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫啊啊……⟪k:1⟫这是神的意志。⟪k:2⟫被诅咒的洋馆里的魔女最终被骑士们制裁了……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A1A1486_1AC2_4F6B_93BF_65F63A063C83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b05c8eb9cbcd565d784a22f7c6b51f88d733fd5ac9c445c8ad05319bbaf61426
#. default-sha256: 85b5846d48a7cfd2ab7e00d12157e4c4dbb65fe1a04ba7405766bbdada158211
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A1A1486_1AC2_4F6B_93BF_65F63A063C83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We have assembled all the tools you need to execute your divine mission. ⟪k:1⟫A cross, "
"befitting of such a heinous sinner!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫来，⟪k:1⟫骑士大人。⟪k:2⟫都准备好了。⟪k:3⟫与被诅咒的魔女非常相称的十字架，⟪k:4⟫就在这里！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_71CEAC7F_E583_49D1_AD46_B531CE5EA92D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53dd32f9a37f62905756822fe5a476bfc508a8eac505a8ca8084849a9c7882f7
#. default-sha256: 86a77a756521c5e229860764ffcc8f7aa76e695a1cd09de6bfc415b9021d8936
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_71CEAC7F_E583_49D1_AD46_B531CE5EA92D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That witch threatened to curse us!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Sullied our pure ears with its blasphemy!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫那个魔女向我们施了诅咒！⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫对无辜的我们进行诅咒！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C92DCB1B_C140_4C09_A9F4_4E152AD3CBD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32466ddace105a06a757c05888fefcbe7584e288bf6719333f3b70e50da1dc78
#. default-sha256: da187f7e5af314985575253349196f032522456452ce5fcb9ccdd20d243054fe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C92DCB1B_C140_4C09_A9F4_4E152AD3CBD0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had done no such thing...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I hadn’t cursed anyone.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I had merely been "
"defending myself..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我什么都没做……⟪k:1⟫没有诅咒任何人。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫我只是，⟪k:4⟫保护了自己而已……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_01CDD73C_7009_4BF2_A713_A9D75E21BF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 701c4216992691faea4bdf31863706b6c520afbacd82a500e51cd83143eeda99
#. default-sha256: 9781ca2d68092e90f09e1185922953c1b8a5fb376f34691561d4436b9b76240a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01CDD73C_7009_4BF2_A713_A9D75E21BF1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They had been armed and outnumbered me...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫so I had said what was necessary to chase "
"them off."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为了从手持武器的民众手上，⟪k:1⟫保护我自己……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫仅是为此，⟪k:4⟫说了几句话而已。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9F09D42E_C560_4E6C_85CC_E1446F093B6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cca5b86de7e5c9e86b6d33b754600a104c0d279017d0917d8373ca8d9dbf92e8
#. default-sha256: d4eb0a1c2401d9eb5426122b603c597562935846c6302ebbfb2480871b6d0d16
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9F09D42E_C560_4E6C_85CC_E1446F093B6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our poor harvest and our suffering at the hands of the greedy lord were all the work of the "
"witch!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫是的，⟪k:1⟫不管是领主用来折磨我们的暴政——⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫还是最近的欠收！⟪k:4⟫都是那个魔女搞的鬼！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_95CFA38E_6A0D_45D8_AC57_B18FBA96D197
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e49508a3c27ffb76ff48fdb12cb20575c3fc10a816273a2dab11b08cd429819b
#. default-sha256: 33e4cf208beec459f9364f8906c0a7560f7bd85da343ac24e21b3c25fa30c5f5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_95CFA38E_6A0D_45D8_AC57_B18FBA96D197"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I prayed. ⟪k:1⟫I asked God to grant me the smallest of miracles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫所以，⟪k:1⟫我只能去请求……扛着我尸体的哥哥。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫我向神祈愿，⟪k:4⟫哪怕只有些微的奇迹也好"
"——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_033A2315_AC2C_41C2_8315_A7996EA3E827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2d954ab68bf72de9edd662400ca8d4d5b22fdfb1b7a498006c5fe685b371f78
#. default-sha256: 123d8b807fe37d2357fcb7e0cf41c98a944947d3abd4be110e2e584ababcd73b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_033A2315_AC2C_41C2_8315_A7996EA3E827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To let my voice reach my brother, who carried my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫请让我的声音……⟪k:1⟫传递给他。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3862AE0C_464A_4525_8ECB_6E3291ABEB35
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39bc06237716615f21662cf2b2f71380114740d154b48f14ffbb9c8d40bbf061
#. default-sha256: fc6751f2f8e6c64a6ce9f2e75b085b677b035cf759aed8efa6eaf6a8b1994ebb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3862AE0C_464A_4525_8ECB_6E3291ABEB35"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You know me better than that...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know I’ve done nothing wrong..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫哥哥……⟪k:1⟫你一定明白的……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫我没有犯下任何罪行……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D009FECC_2960_47A6_8DA6_F92E9871462F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37e68b33b4069461cd27d1248c717e25ea0047c5b978342a234f94afe760cde9
#. default-sha256: 5bcaca02b4575fea8f0906020d8c182d9340d13be4a72d26a4bb4dd93392331c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D009FECC_2960_47A6_8DA6_F92E9871462F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those men smirking at the sight of my body...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they’re the ones putting the blame "
"for their sins on me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫看着我的尸体发笑的那群人，⟪k:1⟫才是真真正正犯过罪的人——⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫他们想把罪名推到我身上……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_00B923A4_C9C9_4378_986A_F8838E238D0B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2cfcb7dc2d6ea8b6e5f00450f6014568b102b84e40675192276669f099fb5bf
#. default-sha256: ff32f112710d009b785db69d7cbf7c09fcdce7f8d9f71e3b07453f1016f7a9ab
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_00B923A4_C9C9_4378_986A_F8838E238D0B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then surely ⟪k:1⟫you⟪k:2⟫ can give me a respectable burial..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫至少希望你能理解我，⟪k:1⟫将我体面地安葬……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B29EA92E_1B87_454B_8F71_08A903F801C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfeb891b03178d6ced7ea4da4f732ffe819add6ae67b7a713c342ae83ffa6793
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B29EA92E_1B87_454B_8F71_08A903F801C9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario7:scenario7_811B82B8_CEB2_4DEE_AEBD_1FA47DD3DB02
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c3d8eefcd7e5ca958e0399398b9ef2c41abc64caba1fe2449784a2d169955ef
#. default-sha256: 6467e00b3108b8874b946a9c52e104f531a01fdda6038ae6a9096c0a19165ff4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_811B82B8_CEB2_4DEE_AEBD_1FA47DD3DB02"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you say nothing?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为什么，⟪k:1⟫你要从那个男人手上——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA47D360_0BC7_473A_B649_CFC04349B927
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f668bb84e55cbb115b1610cfd89ebbf8966e6f8f5e8cb7d5307d6e3fb1d18473
#. default-sha256: be234fbaec671397200a61b1dbb490f5ce41f842358e4ad37c0d30f2af1bd90f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EA47D360_0BC7_473A_B649_CFC04349B927"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why do you accept the tools this man presents you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫接过处罚我的道具，⟪k:1⟫然后——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E6DB3BE6_2FD3_48F8_9DB3_67C9E599D0B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 10e268f56b85ffeadb14330bb7c68f46cc3ae9fe2b9a4aaaec50de5fe5b80ed3
#. default-sha256: b751d032948cc70e92300babf129e7540c010b99bd2f637f1814361e6b45ae07
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E6DB3BE6_2FD3_48F8_9DB3_67C9E599D0B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫tools meant to punish me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫默不作声地点头呢……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5B464F04_9A92_4579_8C51_EC91CD240255
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cf4df8ac48687f2db3e0b43745068bec3aa548f9572c8cde1605fdbbf46cd08
#. default-sha256: 1458024d5de84502a6e4c6b708a265dbd0acbf2e713326fce3b7fd1fc9589508
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5B464F04_9A92_4579_8C51_EC91CD240255"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Tell me, Didier..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为什么，⟪k:1⟫哥哥……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_12D6FB59_6A51_4848_942F_F4928D9277D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 796cc58a4529383c82f5a34db4e25184d2cb5380da6ad680edc7dbe882cac707
#. default-sha256: ebe5ebcdb1cb412bfb6e8d60d165adfd276eac3fe0381de1a8e252184ff1a3f7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_12D6FB59_6A51_4848_942F_F4928D9277D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crucify the witch!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫钉上十字架！！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_06E89998_6C35_4344_BE0B_EE8EF13FA4D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b88122fa784fbfeb68197aaea8991e9fc6af957675fe8b7740c095c8e6416092
#. default-sha256: 6cf523568a2586ac75317211910e9d87131048fbee2f2a44c3c6bfdea349829b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_06E89998_6C35_4344_BE0B_EE8EF13FA4D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Please, anything but that... ⟪k:1⟫I’m begging you...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫don’t expose me to these "
"people..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫求你了，⟪k:1⟫请不要这样……⟪k:2⟫只有这个绝对不行……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫只有将我的肉体暴露给民众这件事——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1281D409_8BEB_4CAE_888D_48DFD6D3CBC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcbab0dc61c4c613d8912b8548bab7ffd82fff981ff6d41832fa4edb5e686c00
#. default-sha256: 78a9fa589374ac6648e8f75e1dfcad71b8e2df59ebdb863e272d282308b17b06
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1281D409_8BEB_4CAE_888D_48DFD6D3CBC6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t expose my body, Didier!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫请你住手，⟪k:1⟫哥哥……！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CF06DD32_7A5D_48DC_AA4A_7BDD93E968AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55dc69f8cc6c5a5e754e75edbf2a0438de5fe8be9ca85b17bb68cc321f8ea977
#. default-sha256: d026ec7346556bc6a05dc167fade4bc6ac8848d8f820e4371b7dc1a2f17f0107
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CF06DD32_7A5D_48DC_AA4A_7BDD93E968AC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m begging you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只有这个，⟪k:1⟫请你……！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D05EA808_47E5_4593_A6B0_973EFD32CE3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8a327ca1e0fa4c3ac38e3d7d24b57bc0d8b03bf0af8dc7210ee9b815dbc999c
#. default-sha256: dccf0cb565f471163f945fa8c0509c8086ef766393d3e6cb88914bdc0858ebc7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D05EA808_47E5_4593_A6B0_973EFD32CE3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But of course, my voice had no way of reaching him,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and he proceeded to remove my "
"clothing, piece by piece,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫哥哥当然听不到我的声音——⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫他漠然地剥掉衣服，⟪k:4⟫让我的皮肤，⟪k:5⟫让我赤裸"
"的肉体——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1DCF0803_C04F_40B6_958E_B00ADB3E0CED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a3e76a7085e886601c20e21d0895e70a5766208a5a4eafd3d554ef20d9e80f4
#. default-sha256: c8072cf30cf70304a7f9a56b7a17aa7c12095d8755bc6375b7a27aab458bbcc4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1DCF0803_C04F_40B6_958E_B00ADB3E0CED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫until I was left fully nude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫暴露在……大庭广众之下。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8239D993_E4CC_494D_AE65_0BC3127CD6EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c370212252ef1e0bb71688b60e3ca7f87303211b415aac4577702d9234c1f49
#. default-sha256: 529619c6a8bc19c714c381043c25f6e4d0e43fdc56b08d4eb5ee18bc73ed79c4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8239D993_E4CC_494D_AE65_0BC3127CD6EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then, with a mocking laugh, one man spoke,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫然后，⟪k:1⟫有个男人半是嘲笑半是苦笑地开了口。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_90C9BCAA_38F4_4491_BFFE_F74F8614A885
